{"scene_id": "s00537", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s00537.fountain", "heading": "EXT. ROADSIDE DRIVE-IN THEATRE - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "ANNELIESE VOSKUIJLEN", "names": ["ANNELIESE VOSKUIJLEN", "ANNELIESE"], "gender": "m", "first": 5, "spoke": 13}, {"id": 1, "name": "CORINNE VASQUEZ-LEE", "names": ["CORINNE VASQUEZ-LEE", "CORINNE"], "gender": "f", "first": 6, "spoke": 5}, {"id": 2, "name": "GABRIEL ACHTERBERG", "names": ["GABRIEL ACHTERBERG", "GABRIEL"], "gender": "?", "first": 22, "spoke": 9}, {"id": 3, "name": "TAKESHI NAKAMURA", "names": ["TAKESHI NAKAMURA", "TAKESHI"], "gender": "?", "first": 42, "spoke": 8}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "EXT. ROADSIDE DRIVE-IN THEATRE - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Rain on a field of parked cars.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "A giant screen, torn at one corner, shows a black-and-white kiss in forty-foot faces.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Speakers hang on posts like mourners.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Windshield wipers keep time.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "At the back of the lot, under the sagging eaves of the projection booth, ANNELIESE VOSKUIJLEN, 30s, a bride in a rain-soaked gown and borrowed denim jacket, stands with a lit cigarette she is not smoking.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Her sister-in-law-to-be CORINNE VASQUEZ-LEE, 30s, a maid of honor with a ruined updo, holds a stolen bottle of champagne by the neck.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Between them, the rain.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Between them, everything.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You can't just walk out of your own wedding.", "name": "CORINNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I walked out of my own wedding.", "name": "ANNELIESE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The caterer is crying.", "name": "CORINNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The caterer is always crying.", "name": "ANNELIESE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Corinne laughs, wet, despite herself.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Hands over the bottle.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Anneliese drinks.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Hands it back.", "para": 3, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He's good, Corinne.", "name": "ANNELIESE", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He's wonderful.", "name": "CORINNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "So why does it feel like a cage?", "name": "ANNELIESE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Maybe because it's a cage you picked.", "name": "CORINNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["gently"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "A silhouette appears at the edge of the lot, umbrella tilted.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "GABRIEL ACHTERBERG, 30s, a groom in a ruined waistcoat, jogs toward them through the puddles, the umbrella useless.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Anna! Anna, I'm not here to --", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["calling"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Gabe.", "name": "ANNELIESE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'll be in the car.", "name": "CORINNE", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Corinne retreats, taking the champagne.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Gabriel arrives, drenched, breathless.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "He stops three feet away.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Your mother is giving a speech to the empty chairs.", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That sounds like her.", "name": "ANNELIESE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I told her you needed air.", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I needed this.", "name": "ANNELIESE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "She gestures at the lot: the rain, the cars, the screen.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "On it, the silent couple kiss again.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I never knew you liked the pictures.", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I came here with my father. Every Friday. Until he sold the Chevy.", "name": "ANNELIESE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You never told me.", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You never asked.", "name": "ANNELIESE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "The sting lands.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "He takes it, nods.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Fair.", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "TAKESHI NAKAMURA, 70s, the projectionist, leans out of the booth window with a thermos and a skeptical eyebrow.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Folks, you are blocking the exit.", "name": "TAKESHI", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Sorry.", "name": "ANNELIESE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Sorry!", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": true, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You two the runaway wedding?", "name": "TAKESHI", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Probably.", "name": "ANNELIESE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Good. Come in. Better view from up here.", "name": "TAKESHI", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Gabriel and Anneliese look at each other, uncertain, then climb the iron stair into the booth.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "It smells of warm dust and film.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "A single projector clatters in the dark, throwing a beam through a square window.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "The old man pours three paper cups from the thermos.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My wife and I watched this one thirty-one years ago. She said, \"He's going to leave her.\"", "name": "TAKESHI", "speaker": 3, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Does he?", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Watch.", "name": "TAKESHI", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "On the screen, the man walks into the rain.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "The woman does not call after him.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "The camera holds on her face.", "para": 11, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Anneliese reaches for Gabriel's hand, does not take it, rests her fingers an inch from his.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She's going to let him.", "name": "ANNELIESE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["quietly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Only in this version.", "name": "TAKESHI", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "The reel clatters.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "The picture jumps.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "In the splice, a frame goes white and then, impossibly, the man turns around.", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Gabriel's breath catches.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Anneliese's hand closes over his.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is that...", "name": "GABRIEL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Different print. Spliced it myself, the winter she died. I couldn't stand the ending either.", "name": "TAKESHI", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Rain on the roof.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Three paper cups.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "The woman on the screen takes one step toward the man.", "para": 15, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Takeshi. You're a terrible projectionist.", "name": "ANNELIESE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["whispering"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And you are a terrible bride.", "name": "TAKESHI", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Gabriel starts to laugh.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "Then Anneliese.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "The old man joins them, wheezing, coughing, shaking his head.", "para": 16, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "Outside, in the car, Corinne watches the window of the booth glow like a lantern and finishes the champagne alone.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}